OCGRAPH 1
DOMAIN gameplay
NAME CollapseMacroTest
DESCRIPTION Collapse to Macro fixture: GraphCollapseTest collapses gt, lt, br, c2, add and st into a macro (a value in, two exec exits, a value out) and writes collapse_macro_test.output.ocgraph; CollapseFunctionTests runs both graphs and compares their variables.

VAR total float 0
VAR misses float 0
VAR last float 0

NODE tick OnTick 0 0
NODE gt GetVar 0 200 var=total
NODE c5 ConstFloat 0 300 value=5
NODE lt Less 200 250
NODE br Branch 300 0
NODE c2 ConstFloat 300 300 value=2
NODE add Add 450 250
NODE st SetVar 500 0 var=total
NODE sl SetVar 800 0 var=last
NODE gm GetVar 600 300 var=misses
NODE c1 ConstFloat 600 400 value=1
NODE addm Add 750 350
NODE sm SetVar 800 100 var=misses

LINK tick.exec br.exec
LINK gt.value lt.a
LINK c5.value lt.b
LINK lt.result br.cond
LINK br.true st.exec
LINK gt.value add.a
LINK c2.value add.b
LINK add.result st.value
LINK st.then sl.exec
LINK add.result sl.value
LINK br.false sm.exec
LINK gm.value addm.a
LINK c1.value addm.b
LINK addm.result sm.value

ENTRY tick OnTick
